{"about_the_game":"<strong>Zombie Chef DEMO </strong> - This demo delivers a short gameplay experience combining cooking and survival.<br>Prepare recipes from the limbs of the zombies you\u2019ve defeated.<br>Serve meals that satisfy the zombies and complete their orders on time.<br>Collect ingredients and door/upgrading equipment from the market.<br>Monitor your home with camera systems and defend it with your weapons.<br>When the Blood Moon rises, all zombies attack! Get ready and survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook for Your Life!</strong></h2><strong>Prepare meals using zombie limbs and store bought ingredients!  <br>Even the slightest mistake will turn the kitchen into a battlefield, and delays will enrage the zombies.  <br>Make dishes with minced limbs, meat, intestines, and brains!  <br>To survive, you must be both fast and careful!</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.poster.avif?t=1758124869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.webm?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.mp4?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show No Weakness!</strong></h2><strong>You won\u2019t easily get rid of attacking zombies!  <br>Even with their bodies torn apart, they remain dangerous arms ripped off, they still attack; legs severed, they crawl after you.  <br>Once you stop them, carefully drag their bodies to cold storage.  <br>One careless moment, and you\u2019ll become one of them.</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/fd3e76b17eca2938edacccbeacc061bc.poster.avif?t=1758124869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/fd3e76b17eca2938edacccbeacc061bc.webm?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/fd3e76b17eca2938edacccbeacc061bc.mp4?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crush and Store!</strong></h2><strong>Carry severed zombie limbs and bodies into the cold storage, hang them on hooks, and cut them into pieces.  <br>Store the parts neatly so they\u2019ll be ready for bloody preparations in the kitchen.</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/5eb0a46a1ae3e3aa2ee8717ccda16603.poster.avif?t=1758124869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/5eb0a46a1ae3e3aa2ee8717ccda16603.webm?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/5eb0a46a1ae3e3aa2ee8717ccda16603.mp4?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Market!</strong></h2><strong>At the market, you\u2019ll find not only ingredients for recipes but also tools like cameras, traps, weapons, and hammers to upgrade doors.  <br>Grabbing the right supplies and equipment quickly makes cooking and defense easier; delays will lead to bloody consequences.</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/dbf4c7bd316396dd6d37906ba764cb97.poster.avif?t=1758124869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/dbf4c7bd316396dd6d37906ba764cb97.webm?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/dbf4c7bd316396dd6d37906ba764cb97.mp4?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bloody Moon!</strong></h2><strong>When the Bloody Moon rises, zombie hunger becomes unstoppable!  <br>Doors, traps, and defenses won\u2019t hold them back.  <br>A furious undead horde will come knocking at your door!  <br>Prepare your defenses quickly and do everything you can to survive!</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/050c260d33c7dd4787197768227d6017.poster.avif?t=1758124869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/050c260d33c7dd4787197768227d6017.webm?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/050c260d33c7dd4787197768227d6017.mp4?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect Yourself!</strong></h2><strong>Defend your home against ever growing zombie attacks each night!  <br>Reinforce your doors, add locks, and control your defense line.  <br>Use bear traps and cameras to detect and neutralize approaching zombies.  <br>Discover new weapons to increase your firepower and make your defense even deadlier!</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/a73e59c58ae7ca81e5ee6a516f543fa9.poster.avif?t=1758124869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/a73e59c58ae7ca81e5ee6a516f543fa9.webm?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/a73e59c58ae7ca81e5ee6a516f543fa9.mp4?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>  <br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038340?t=1758124869","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038340?t=1758124869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/a4ff15f3966d3c1bc092489717f3a5b918d01085/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758124869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/a4ff15f3966d3c1bc092489717f3a5b918d01085/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758124869","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains content that may not be suitable for all ages or may be inappropriate for viewing in the workplace. It includes violence (such as decapitation or dismemberment of zombie-like creatures, use of internal organs), depictions of blood, and mild profanity. The game contains violence, blood, and general mature content.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<strong>Zombie Chef DEMO </strong> - This demo delivers a short gameplay experience combining cooking and survival.<br>Prepare recipes from the limbs of the zombies you\u2019ve defeated.<br>Serve meals that satisfy the zombies and complete their orders on time.<br>Collect ingredients and door/upgrading equipment from the market.<br>Monitor your home with camera systems and defend it with your weapons.<br>When the Blood Moon rises, all zombies attack! Get ready and survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook for Your Life!</strong></h2><strong>Prepare meals using zombie limbs and store bought ingredients!  <br>Even the slightest mistake will turn the kitchen into a battlefield, and delays will enrage the zombies.  <br>Make dishes with minced limbs, meat, intestines, and brains!  <br>To survive, you must be both fast and careful!</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.poster.avif?t=1758124869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.webm?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/0f9db94ac4804ef588ea7b89acee3d9e.mp4?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show No Weakness!</strong></h2><strong>You won\u2019t easily get rid of attacking zombies!  <br>Even with their bodies torn apart, they remain dangerous arms ripped off, they still attack; legs severed, they crawl after you.  <br>Once you stop them, carefully drag their bodies to cold storage.  <br>One careless moment, and you\u2019ll become one of them.</strong>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/fd3e76b17eca2938edacccbeacc061bc.poster.avif?t=1758124869\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038340/extras/fd3e76b17eca2938edacccbeacc061bc.webm?t=1758124869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com